        "original_id": "d5d552df-6dd3-57e7-ae59-e283453d91c4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stacey McClean, Biff Byford, Frankie Sandford, Jay Asforis, Daisy Evans, Calvin Goldspink, Aaron Renfree, Hannah Richings, Rochelle Wiseman\n- Organizations: S Club 8, Saxon\n- Events: S Club Search\n\nFacts:\n- Biff Byford was born on 15 January 1951.\n- Biff Byford is an English singer best known as the lead singer of the heavy metal band Saxon.\n- Stacey McClean was born on 17 February 1989.\n- Stacey McClean is an English solo singer.\n- In 2001, Frankie Sandford, Jay Asforis, Daisy Evans, Calvin Goldspink, Stacey McClean, Aaron Renfree, Hannah Richings, and Rochelle Wiseman were chosen for S Club 8 from thousands of hopefuls on the television series S Club Search.\n- In 2001, the members chosen for S Club 8 were all in their early teens or younger.",
